:: MP Region Foghorn Island [nobr]
<<effects>>
海雾在孤悬海外的礁岛四周翻涌，高耸的雾角灯塔矗立在嶙峋的黑色岩崖之上。海浪拍击着古老的石砌栈桥，远处断桅沉船滩的残骸在潮水涨落间若隐若现。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
<br><br>

<<walkicon>><<link [[前往雾角栈桥 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>

<<walkicon>><<link [[前往守塔人旧居 (0:08)|MP Region Foghorn Keeper]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>

<<walkicon>><<link [[前往断桅沉船滩 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Wreck]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>

<<walkicon>><<link [[前往海蚀回音廊 (0:09)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
<br>

<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁 (0:18)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 18>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: MP Region Foghorn Pier [nobr]
<<effects>>
青石垒成的古老栈桥延伸入迷雾笼罩的海面，系船柱上缠绕着潮湿的缆绳与海草。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[仔细搜寻雾角栈桥的隐秘角落 (0:11)|MP Region Foghorn Pier Search]]>><<pass 11>><<stress -4>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
